// Stopper stream with undefined as filter (section 2.2)
// Author: not credited on the listing page
// Source: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Appendix I (KScript and KSWorld), section 2.2, lead-in 'the stream stopper below does not update beyond 1,000', PDF page 23 (printed page 22)
// Also printed in: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Appendix II (Making Applications in KSWorld), section 2.2, boxed snippet 'the stream stopper below', PDF page 40 (printed page 39)
// Transcribed from the page images; text-layer differences noted below.

stopper <- if myTimer > 1000 then undefined else myTimer
timerViewer <- stopper / 100

